category: Text
build-depends: cygport libaspell-devel libhunspell-devel libglib2.0-devel
sdesc: "Interface to various spell checking libraries"
ldesc: "The project aims to provide an efficient extensible abstraction
for dealing with different spell checking libraries. Enchant is meant to
provide a generic interface into various existing spell checking libraries."
